# Endpoint the "Book a Consultation" form POSTs enquiries to (JSON body).
# Production builds default to the backend's lead-capture route
# (https://api.buildpanda.io/leads/consultation), which emails the enquiry to
# the team inbox. The backend must allow this site's origin (its CORS list).
# Leave unset in development: submissions are logged to the console instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LEADS_ENDPOINT=
# Search Console HTML-tag verification code (content of the google-site-verification meta tag).
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
